+<section class="section" id="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2>Questions, answered.</h2><p>The details that make choosing easy.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. Team includes a 14-day free trial, with no credit card required. You can also stay on Free for as long as you like.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing to save 20% on paid plans. The full discounted amount is billed once per user for the year. Free stays free.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Any admin can upgrade or downgrade a workspace at any time. Your plan changes apply to your next billing cycle.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Add people whenever you need. Paid plans are priced per user, so your bill adjusts to match your active team.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our team to Relay?</summary><p>Yes. Our team can help you import conversations and get everyone settled in. Contact us and we’ll make a plan together.</p></details></div></div></section>
